{"ref":"BDB, אָרְנָן","hw":"אָרְנָן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אָרְנָן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> a Jebusite, whose threshing-floor was bought by David to erect an altar <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 21:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.21.15\">1 Ch 21:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 21:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.21.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 21:20\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.21.20\">20</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 21:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.21.21\">21</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 21:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.21.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 21:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.21.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 21:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.21.24\">24</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 21:25\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.21.25\">25</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 21:28\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.21.28\">28</a>, & according to <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 3:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.3.1\">2 Ch 3:1</a> became site of temple; called <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרַוְנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.16\">2 S 24:16 f.</a> q.v.","next":"BDB, אַרְנוֹן","prev":"BDB, אַרְנָן"}